      ],
      "summary": "World Central Kitchen (WCK) provides rapid food response to humanitarian crises and natural disasters globally. The organization reported <cite id=\"3\">$327,840,221 in total revenue</cite> in FY2024 to support its international emergency feeding operations. WCK holds a <cite id=\"1\">100/100 overall rating from Charity Navigator</cite> and earned a <cite id=\"1\">Platinum Seal of Transparency from Candid</cite>. Financial filings show a <cite id=\"1\">92.5% program expense Ratio</cite> in FY2024, directing most funding toward frontline relief. The organization relies on direct service delivery, offering emergency meals during acute humanitarian emergencies worldwide. While WCK accepts general donations and sadaqah contributions, it does not maintain a dedicated zakat framework.",
